== choice_1
Guan Sanzhu is not your real name? #Layout:Right
I knew it, nothing can escape the Arbiter’s eyes. I didn’t mean to hide it, I just got used to being called Sanzhu. #Layout:Left

To be honest, during the war, <color=red>I deserted the army</color>, and the master took me in, covering it up for me. Ever since then, I’ve been living under the name Guan Sanzhu. Even now in death, I go by that name. #Layout:Left
    ->END
  
== choice_2
    // 姓名是否一致
    That’s right! I’m a big, strong man. What’s the matter?   #Layout:Left
    ->END

