== choice_8
As a man, being a soldier is supposed to be my duty. But the battledied is terrifying... #Layout:Left

    ->END

== choice_9
That’s right, I was born on the seventeenth day of the first lunar month, right in the freezing cold of winter. We were so poor back then, we couldn’t even afford charcoal. #Layout:Left

    ->END
    
== choice_10
Mid-Autumn Festival, huh. I sure wish the master could see the lantern festival at the market. #Layout:Left
    ->END
    
== choice_11
 I’m from Leizhou too. Got drafted to the north for a few years during the war. After I came back, I stayed with the master ever since. #Layout:Left

    ->END

